## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Fix Effort | Rationale |
|----------|-------|-----------|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | Low | Silent false-pass — highest risk of hiding regressions |
| 2 | Conditional Test Logic | Low | Hidden untested path — split into two tests |
| 3 | Sleepy Test | Medium | Flakiness source + slows CI by 2s per run |
| 4 | Mystery Guest | Low | Blocks CI entirely (path doesn't exist) |
| 5 | Exception Handling | Low | One-line swap to `Assert.ThrowsException` |
| 6 | Eager Test | Medium | Split into focused unit tests |
| 7 | Magic Number Test | Low | Add named constants for clarity |
| 8 | Sensitive Equality | Medium | Requires `OrderSummary` to expose properties |
| 9 | General Fixture | Low | Delete one unused field |

